{"id":"25f120c26bfc86b7","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-oracle-jump.md","title":"Turing Jump","display":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-oracle-jump","aliases":["73-df-binary-oracle-jump","73-df-turing-jump"],"display":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump","depends_on":["[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]","[[73-df-binary-oracle-decision]]"],"source_id":"HU1979","source_ref":"§8.8–8.9 and §13.7, pp. 207–213, 362–364; local oracle/representation interfaces","source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§8.8–8.9 and §13.7, pp. 207–213, 362–364; local oracle/representation interfaces","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"outside-third-edition","third_edition_relation":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-oracle-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-oracle-jump</span><span>73-df-turing-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-jump — Turing Jump"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd5cc3818e5e9993\" href=\"?note=fd5cc3818e5e9993\" title=\"73-df-binary-oracle-decision\">73-df-binary-oracle-decision</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.8–8.9 and §13.7, pp. 207–213, 362–364; local oracle/representation interfaces"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§8.8–8.9 and §13.7, pp. 207–213, 362–364; local oracle/representation interfaces"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*\\)</span> (oracle language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})\">\\(\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})\\)</span> (oracle-program coding, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab6c7ca255afa826\" href=\"?note=ab6c7ca255afa826\" title=\"73-df-oracle-program-semantics\">73-df-oracle-program-semantics</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^A\">\\(\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^A\\)</span> (oracle halting predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\nA&#39;_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner O\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}}:\nO\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\land\n\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^A(\\ulcorner O\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}})\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\nA&#39;_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner O\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}}:\nO\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\land\n\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^A(\\ulcorner O\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}})\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The oracle-program code is a genuine parameter of the jump. Any two acceptable effective coding packages yield Turing-equivalent jumps.</li>\n<li>For the empty oracle, this diagonal oracle-halting language is Turing-equivalent to the ordinary diagonal halting language.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-oracle-decision","status":"resolved","id":"fd5cc3818e5e9993","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-oracle-decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-oracle-program-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}$ with $\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})$ (oracle-program coding, see [[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbf 2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}jump}\\vdash\nA'_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner O\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}}:\nO\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{OTM}}\\land\n\\operatorname{OHalts}_O^A(\\ulcorner O\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O}})\\}","display":true}],"bytes":2028,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-362","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-oracle-jump|Turing Jump]]"}],"outgoing":["ab6c7ca255afa826","fd5cc3818e5e9993"]}